# Line endings are a CORRECTNESS control here, not a style preference, for a
# reason specific to this package: similarity is computed over TOKENS derived
# from bullet text, and the fixtures hold that text in multi-line template
# literals. A CRLF checkout puts \r inside those strings, which changes the
# token stream and therefore changes a Dice score — so a threshold test would
# pass for whoever authored the fixture and fail on a clean clone, or worse,
# pass on both machines with a different bullet matched.
#
# core.autocrlf=true is set in this machine's SYSTEM gitconfig (verified
# 2026-09-10), so without this file git converts on checkout.
* text eol=lf
